Gyires's permanent inequality for circulant matrices of order five

Source: Dev D. Goyal, https://github.com/dvgyl/gyires-circulant-5
Commit: 72cf49a51be42cf15592f91d991f0b0c76f58448
License: Apache License 2.0

The original source records contributions from Dev D. Goyal, GPT-6 with Pro reasoning, and Claude Opus 5.5. The manuscript gives the historical contribution record and its limits.

PermanentGram.lean adapts a proof by Chris Ozols from the order-four Gyires development, https://github.com/cozuya/gyires-permanent-4x4. The original copyright and Apache-2.0 notices are preserved in that file.

This collection changes module paths and namespaces, revises the manuscript, adds a separate bibliography, and adds current verification records. The original source repository is unchanged.

The integrated preprint adds the later permutation-polynomial and four-block arguments from the supplied Gyires research materials. Their source hashes and historical notes are recorded in research-notes/gyires-extensions/provenance.json. Their Lean verification remains incomplete.
